sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Syndicate user
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant G as Neo4j
  participant M as Model (Ollama)
  U->>W: Ask "What is left before launch?"
  W->>A: POST /copilot/chat (token from cookie)
  A->>A: rewrite follow-up, classify intent
  A->>G: read tasks of the deal and search playbook
  G-->>A: numbered sources S1..Sn
  A->>M: answer ONLY from these sources, cite [S#]
  M-->>A: streamed tokens
  A-->>W: meta (sources), tokens, done (cited)
  A->>G: audit event: model, prompt hash, sources
  W-->>U: answer with an Evidence panel
